Code (each file carries the notice in its header):
- bin/ud                    derived from bin/um (the uv launcher)
- hooks/add-to-path.sh      derived from hooks/add-to-path.sh (SessionStart PATH hook)
- ud/cli.py                 derived from um/cli.py (group dispatcher)
- ud/common.py              derived from um/common.py (platform and WSL path helpers)
- ud/kb.py                  derived from um/kb.py (knowledge base: sync, search, check, index, new, pr)
- ud/publish.py             secret and decompiler-fingerprint patterns derived from um/publish.py
- tests/test_repo.py        the skill-copy test and the PATH-hook tests derived from tests/test_um.py
- tests/test_kb.py          parts of the knowledge-base tests derived from tests/test_um.py

Structure and text (adapted, not copied verbatim):
- hooks/hooks.json, .claude/settings.json, .claude-plugin/, .codex-plugin/, .cursor-plugin/,
  .agents/plugins/marketplace.json, gemini-extension.json, opencode.json, plugin.json: same layout as
  universal-modder's manifests
- AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, GEMINI.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, .github/pull_request_template.md: structure adapted
- skills/share-field-notes/SKILL.md: adapted from skills/share-field-notes/SKILL.md
- skills/decompile-any-binary/SKILL.md: section structure (tools table, the loop, hard rules, references)
  modelled on skills/mod-any-game/SKILL.md
- knowledge/README.md, knowledge/TEMPLATE.md: structure adapted from knowledge/README.md, knowledge/TEMPLATE.md
